 "text": "Lincoln County, SD | Official Website\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout Us\nDepartments\nGovernment\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nBids & RFPs\nEmployment\nVoter Information\nProperty Tax\nInteractive Maps\nAgendas & Minutes\nNEWS & HIGHLIGHTS\nKeep informed with the latest news and highlights\nNotice of Road Closure\nOn October 20th, the intersection of CR117 (Louise Ave) and CR106 (271st) will be closed for utility work. The closure is scheduled for three days, opening by the end of the day on October 22nd. Please follow the detour route. Read on...\nNOTICE OF DEADLINE FOR VOTER REGISTRATION\nVoter registration for the General Election to be held on November 3rd, will close on October 19th at 5:00 p.m. Read on...\nNOTICE OF GENERAL ELECTION\nA General Election will be held on Tuesday, November 3rd, 2026, in all the voting precincts in Lincoln County.\nThe election polls will be open from seven a.m. to seven p.m. central time on the day of the election. Read on...\nView All News\n/CivicAlerts.aspx\nMeetings\nEvents\nMeetings\nOct\n19\nPlanning & Zoning Commission Meeting\nPlanning & Zoning Commission Meeting Read On\nOct\n27\nLincoln County Commission\nLincoln County Commission Read On\nNov\n5\nLincoln County Commission\nLincoln County Commission Read On\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nEvents\nNov\n11\nAdministration Offices Closed Veterans Day\nAdministration Offices Closed Veterans Day Read On\nNov\n26\nAdministration Offices Closed Thanksgiving Day\nAdministration Offices Closed Thanksgiving Day Read On\nNov\n27\nAdministration Offices Closed Day After Thanksgiving\nAdministration Offices Closed Day After Thanksgiving Read On\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nCOUNTY COMMISSIONERS\nMeet the Council\nFind My District\nMeetings & More Information\nAgendas & Minutes\nJoel Arends\nDistrict 1\nHerman Otten\nDistrict 2\nTiffani Landeen\nDistrict 3\nDoug Putnam\nDistrict 4\nJim Schmidt\nDistrict 5\nContact Us\nLincoln County Courthouse\n104 N Main Street\nCanton, SD 57013\nContact Us\n8:00 am – 5:00 pm\nMonday - Friday ( Excluding Holidays )\nImportant Links\nCommission\nElections\nGIS\nMarriage Licenses\nSheriff\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
